      H       -3.0805599984        0.2971399995        0.3108299992
      H       -1.5562300009        0.2544499986       -1.4412100004
      C        1.9663299988        0.1054200010        0.1879700001
      H        2.8963000015        0.3267899997       -0.3340899993
